Garrick Textiles was a [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]] subsidiary that produced fabrics and clothing for the majority of Edan. It began as an importer of raw cotton from [[Geography/Lorandris/index|Lorandris]], then bought up other importers in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and integrated into clothing manufacture, and grew into the largest textile importer and clothing maker in [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. It worked in every kind of textile, including performance cloths, and took private commissions; [[People/Benny|Benny]]'s sailcloth sports poncho was one.

Garrick Textiles' berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] held the Heart [[Org/Garrick Textiles/Whirling in Rags|Whirling in Rags]]. That Heart is dead, and the fane it raised there has melted back into the ground; nothing of the Org is left on the crossing.
